    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1745928422\" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1745928422\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1745928422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/725befe92603be9ae2c25faf747179d1.avif?t=1745928422\" data-has-big width=800 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1745928422\" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1745928422\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1745928422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/725befe92603be9ae2c25faf747179d1.avif?t=1745928422\" data-has-big width=800 height=522 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Robot Hospice&quot; is a 2D pixel art adventure game where beloved robots spend their final days in a hospice. As a new staff member, you will gently yet painfully bid farewell to these cherished machines that once lived alongside humans.",
